## Import

Import an existing workflow. The import ID is `<workflow_group_id>/<workflow_id>`.

### Using an import block (Terraform v1.5.0 and later)
```terraform
import {
  to = stackguardian_workflow_from_template.example
  id = "my-workflow-group/my-workflow"
}
```

### Using the CLI
```bash
terraform import stackguardian_workflow_from_template.example my-workflow-group/my-workflow
```

